---
config:
  theme: base
  fontFamily: "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 24
    width: 130
    diagramMarginX: 10
    boxMargin: 12
    boxTextMargin: 8
    messageMargin: 40
    noteMargin: 22
    labelBoxWidth: 56
    labelBoxHeight: 28
    messageFontSize: 16
    actorFontSize: 16
    noteFontSize: 15
    wrap: false
  themeVariables:
    textColor: "#8b5cf6"
    actorBkg: "#ede9fe"
    actorBorder: "#7c3aed"
    actorTextColor: "#4c1d95"
    actorLineColor: "#a78bfa"
    signalColor: "#8b949e"
    signalTextColor: "#6e7781"
    labelBoxBkgColor: "#ccfbf1"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#0d9488"
    labelTextColor: "#134e4a"
    loopTextColor: "#0d9488"
    noteBkgColor: "#fef3c7"
    noteBorderColor: "#d97706"
    noteTextColor: "#78350f"
    activationBkgColor: "#c4b5fd"
    activationBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    mainBkg: "#ede9fe"
    nodeBorder: "#7c3aed"
    secondaryColor: "#ede9fe"
    secondaryBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    secondaryTextColor: "#4c1d95"
    tertiaryColor: "#ede9fe"
    tertiaryBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    tertiaryTextColor: "#4c1d95"
  themeCSS: >
    svg, .label, .nodeLabel, .edgeLabel, foreignObject div { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    .actor { filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18)); }
    rect.actor { rx: 12px; ry: 12px; }
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Page as StepIt UI
    participant Cmd as stepit_server
    participant Robot as position_controller
    participant Shot as Freezer, camera

    Page->>Cmd: FocusStack {shots, stage_from,<br/>stage_to, angles}
    Note over Cmd: EnsureControllers,<br/>LoadValues near, far
    Cmd->>Robot: first position,<br/>past it and back
    loop every angle, every shot
        Cmd->>Robot: the rail at this shot
        Robot-->>Cmd: /joint_states:<br/>arrived, stopped
        Cmd->>Shot: Shoot
        Shot-->>Cmd: /camera/picture
        Cmd-->>Page: /focus_stack/progress
    end
    Cmd-->>Page: /focus_stack/stack_done,<br/>per angle
    Cmd->>Robot: every joint home
    Cmd-->>Page: FocusStack succeeded
